<title>USA: Tambrands shareholders approve acquisition.</title>
<headline>Tambrands shareholders approve acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tambrands Inc said Wednesday its shareholders approved the previously announced acquisition of the company by Procter &amp; Gamble.</p>
<p>Procter &amp; Gamble announced in April it agreed to buy Tambrands in a deal vauled at about $1.85 billion.  </p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, announced in April, Procter &amp; Gamble said it would acquire all aspects of Tambrands businesses, including manufacturing, technical and other facilities and also its debt.</p>
